        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>端午万宁三日游安排得明明白白 - 第二天</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #eaf6fb;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #eaf6fb;\n    padding-bottom: 40px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title-bar {\n    background: #111;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 14px 6px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .title-bar .highlight {\n    color: #ffd400;\n    font-size: 30px;\n  }\n  .day-label {\n    background: #ffe14d;\n    color: #111;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    width: 90px;\n    margin: 18px auto 8px 30px;\n    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  }\n  .timeline-col {\n    width: 130px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .time-label {\n    background: #ffe14d;\n    color: #111;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    width: 100px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  }\n  .arrow {\n    color: #ffd400;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 34px;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 180px;\n    height: 130px;\n    background: #cfd8dc;\n    border: 1px dashed #90a4ae;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #455a64;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .text-block {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    padding-right: 10px;\n  }\n  .text-block h3 {\n    color: #009fda;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .text-block p {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #222;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">\n    端午万宁<span class=\"highlight\">三日游</span>安排得明明白白\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"day-label\">第二天</div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-col\">\n      <!-- spacer to align with image top -->\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 巴厘村牌坊，情侣着泰式服装合影]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-block\">\n      <h3>巴厘村</h3>\n      <p>去巴厘村拍照，假装自己在泰国，租一套服装(80/人)而且还需要门票。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-col\">\n      <div class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</div>\n      <div class=\"time-label\">打车25分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 桥海牧场，木栈道田地风光]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-block\">\n      <h3>桥海牧场</h3>\n      <p>是类似于农村的田地，有一群牛羊鹅等农家动物!体验感一般，但拍照不错。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-col\">\n      <div class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</div>\n      <div class=\"time-label\">打车10分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 神州半岛红白条纹灯塔]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-block\">\n      <h3>神州半岛灯塔</h3>\n      <p>拍照真的很出片，不要去太早，很有宫崎骏漫画的感觉</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-col\">\n      <div class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</div>\n      <div class=\"time-label\">打车1小时</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 山钦湾洞穴中女子看海剪影]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-block\">\n      <h3>山钦湾</h3>\n      <p>傍晚的时候可以去燕子洞拍夕阳剪影，还有很多礁石，真的是分钟氛围感大片!</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-col\">\n      <div class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</div>\n      <div class=\"time-label\">打车1小时</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 兴隆夜市，摆满水果蔬菜的摊位]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-block\">\n      <h3>兴隆夜市</h3>\n      <p>如果想吃南洋风味等一系列东南亚美食，可以看看这里便宜好吃实惠!</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-col\">\n      <div class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
